OL,3,GNEWSAFour Sussex police officers deny
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour Sussex Police officers have denied
OL,7,Fassault charges relating to two
OL,8,Fseparate incidents in Brighton and
OL,9,FCrawley.
OL,11,FForenzo Fenu, 28, and Richard Harris,
OL,12,F36, denied assaulting a man at the
OL,13,FRoyal Sussex County Hospital in
OL,14,FBrighton in April.
OL,16,FJames Reilly, 41, and Pablo Cabanes,
OL,17,F25, denied charges of assault
OL,18,Foccasioning actual bodily harm relating
OL,19,Fto an alleged assault on a man in
OL,20,FCrawley in March.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
