OL,3,GNEWSAFour Sussex police officers deny
OL,4,Aassault charges
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll four officers appeared at Sevenoaks
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on Tuesday after
OL,8,Fcharges were brought following
OL,9,Finvestigations by the Independent
OL,10,FOffice for Police Conduct (IOPC).
